WEBVTT

00:03:58.681 --> 00:04:00.914
(Laughter)

00:04:00.938 --> 00:04:03.891
And because it's an internal desire,

00:04:03.915 --> 00:04:06.249
we actually have some sense
of control over that.

00:04:06.273 --> 00:04:07.803
I could decide that I'm hungry

00:04:07.827 --> 00:04:11.334
but know that it's not
a great time to eat.

00:04:11.358 --> 00:04:13.996
And then when we get together
with someone for pizza,

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:16.846
we're not competing with them,

00:04:16.870 --> 00:04:18.346
we're looking for an experience

00:04:18.370 --> 00:04:19.632
that both of us will share

00:04:19.656 --> 00:04:21.606
that's satisfying for both of us,

00:04:21.630 --> 00:04:24.611
and when you get together
for pizza with somebody,

00:04:24.635 --> 00:04:26.159
what's the first thing you do?

00:04:26.183 --> 00:04:28.081
You talk about it.

00:04:28.105 --> 00:04:29.612
You talk about what you want.

00:04:29.636 --> 00:04:31.105
You talk about what you like.